    "detailed_description": "You are a brave traveler who got lost in a dark labyrinth, beware of the evil skeletons.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe evil skeletons know where you are, and they are already hunting you. Can you defeat them?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this thrilling arcade game, you control a traveler who is seeking adventure in a mysterious labyrinth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood luck on your journey, and don't forget to collect all the coins! \ud83c\udf1f<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n- Coins<br />\r\n- Skeletons: Beware of the skeletons! They will try to catch you. Use your agility to avoid them.<br />\r\n- Defeat monsters: Your goal is to defeat all the skeletons before they catch you.<br />\r\n- Difficulty levels: The labyrinth may be challenging, with narrow corridors and hidden corners. But don't worry, you can handle it!<br />\r\n- 3D",
